Subject: [PATCH 12/37] Add basic test infrastructure for APB modules

---
 Bender.yml      |   4 ++
 src/apb_test.sv | 114 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 118 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/apb_test.sv

diff --git a/Bender.yml b/Bender.yml
index 99a0342..efcd84a 100644
--- a/Bender.yml
+++ b/Bender.yml
@@ -20,3 +20,7 @@ sources:
   - src/apb_bus.sv
